offline
- the service worker precaches a hand-written list of files (ASSETS in
  service-worker.js), missing most modules: the rest are cached only when first fetched,
  so a page that dynamically imports one (first-time-auth.js, song-utils.js, ...) can
  fail offline if it hasn't been loaded online yet. Precache every app module, keeping
  the list in step with the files (a test that compares it with public/ would do, as
  there's no build step). Also check CDN_ASSETS still matches what pages load

